 | `stats.py` | `interval_stats` (delivered FPS, jitter, gaps, stalls, histogram), `StallDetector`, `CaptureStats` |

 | `source.py` | `LiveFrameSource` (`FrameSource`): capture thread -> t_capture policy -> duplicate refusal -> queue -> `FrameSample` |

